<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0d1c30"><title>Developer monitoring · Kebpro</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/partner/assets/developer-monitor.css"></head>
<body><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-inner"><a class="brand" href="/partner-admin/" aria-label="Kebpro staff portal"><span class="brand-mark">K</span><span>KEBPRO <small>OPERATIONS</small></span></a><span class="topbar-label">DEVELOPER TOOLS</span></div></header>
<main><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SYSTEM OVERVIEW</p><h1>Developer monitoring<span>.</span></h1><p class="intro">A clear view of your system and recent push activity.</p></div><div class="refresh-group"><span id="checked" class="checked" role="status">Checking status…</span><button id="refresh" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">↻</span> Refresh</button></div></div>
<div id="error" role="alert" hidden></div>
<section class="overview" aria-labelledby="overview-title"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR SYSTEM</p><h2 id="overview-title">At a glance</h2></div><span class="section-note">Updates every minute</span></div><div id="health" class="health-grid" aria-live="polite"><p class="loading">Checking system status…</p></div></section>
<section class="activity" aria-labelledby="activity-title"><div class="section-heading activity-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NOTIFICATIONS</p><h2 id="activity-title">Push history</h2><p class="section-description">Explore recent notifications and their delivery details.</p></div><label class="search"><span class="sr-only">Search push history</span><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="filter" type="search" placeholder="Search partner, type or status"></label></div><div class="info-note"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><p><strong>About delivery status</strong> Accepted means the push service accepted the request. It does not confirm the notification appeared on the device.</p></div><div class="history-heading"><span>RECENT ACTIVITY</span><span id="history-count"></span></div><div id="history" class="history"><p class="empty">Loading activity…</p></div></section>
<footer>KEBPRO <span>·</span> Developer monitoring</footer></main><script src="/partner/assets/developer-monitor.js" defer></script></body></html>
